+# Best Open Source AI Automation Tools for 2026
+
+[![Awesome](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/sindresorhus/awesome@main/media/badge.svg)](https://github.com/sindresorhus/awesome)
+[![License: MIT](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-yellow.svg)](https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)
+![Topics](https://img.shields.io/github/stars/GagnDeep/awesome-best-open-source-ai-automation-tools-2026?style=social)
+
+> This curated list covers the best open source AI automation tools for 2026 with a strict focus on public GitHub repositories, self-hosted or code-first workflows, and transparent licensing. It is designed for builders comparing agent frameworks, MCP servers, workflow engines, and AI-powered automation stacks without relying on proprietary SaaS products.
+
+## Table of Contents
+- [TL;DR](#tldr)
+- [Why This List](#why-this-list)
+- [Open Source Tools](#open-source-tools)
+- [FAQ](#faq)
+- [Contributing](#contributing)
+- [License](#license)
