+- **License:** MIT
+- **Last Commit:** ![GitHub last commit](https://img.shields.io/github/last-commit/username/repo)
+- **Category:** tag1, tag2
+- **Best for:** specific use case
+```
+
+## Quality Bar
+
+This repo is curated, not exhaustive. Submissions may be declined if they are:
+
+- Off-topic
+- Duplicative
+- Low-signal
+- Archived or abandoned
+- Missing a valid GitHub repo URL
+
+## Reporting Issues
+
+Open an issue if:
+
+- A repository has been archived, renamed, or removed.
+- Metadata is outdated.
+- A category is misleading.
+- A listed tool is not actually open source.
