+## Why This List
+The best open source AI automation tools matter because teams increasingly want automation that is inspectable, self-hostable, forkable, and adaptable to their own data, infrastructure, and governance rules. A useful list should not mix in closed SaaS products or vague “AI tools” that lack a public codebase. This repository only includes projects that resolve to public `github.com` URLs and organizes them by practical use case so developers, operators, and technical founders can evaluate real open source options faster.
