+- `buildship-ai/buildship`, `EDEAI/OpenFlux`, and `vmDeshpande/ai-agent-automation` fit teams that want visual or code-driven workflow orchestration with AI in the loop.
+- `codescan-ai/codescan`, `marcusquinn/aidevops`, and `ops0-ai/ops0-cli` are better aligned with engineering and DevOps automation.
+- `obsei/obsei`, `BetaStreetOmnis/xhs_ai_publisher`, and `takeshy/obsidian-gemini-helper` show that AI automation is also practical for content, knowledge, and social workflows.
+- Commit activity is shown with live GitHub badges because the exported research dataset contained stars, languages, and licenses, but not point-in-time commit dates.
