+### Thin Categories and Current Gaps
+
+The supplied research dataset also surfaced some categories with fewer than five strong public GitHub candidates. Rather than padding the list with weak matches, these are documented as gaps:
+
+- **Database-centric AI automation:** only one clear match surfaced in the provided research export, and it overlaps with [buildship](https://github.com/buildship-ai/buildship) already listed above.
+- **Installer-only or docs-only repos:** projects like `n8n-install` or `n8n-docs` appeared in search results, but they are not product repositories for open source AI automation tools themselves, so they were excluded.
+- **Automation-adjacent awesome lists:** repositories such as `awesome-ai-tools` and `awesome-claude-skills` are directories of resources, not the tools being compared here.
