+
+> This curated list covers the best open source AI automation tools for 2026 with a strict focus on public GitHub repositories, self-hosted or code-first workflows, and transparent licensing. It is designed for builders comparing agent frameworks, MCP servers, workflow engines, and AI-powered automation stacks without relying on proprietary SaaS products.
